 "ejercicios": [
  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-2-1",
   "n": 1,
   "num": 1,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(f\\) la función definida por \\(f(x)=\\dfrac{e^x}{x-1}\\) para \\(x\\neq1\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1 p.) Estudia y calcula las asíntotas de la gráfica de \\(f\\).",
     "(1,5 p.) Halla los intervalos de crecimiento y de decrecimiento y los extremos relativos (abscisas donde se obtienen y valores que se alcanzan) de \\(f\\)."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p><b>Asíntota vertical.</b> El denominador se anula en \\(x=1\\) y el numerador no:</p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to1^-}\\frac{e^x}{x-1}=\\frac e{0^-}=-\\infty,\\qquad\\lim_{x\\to1^+}\\frac{e^x}{x-1}=\\frac e{0^+}=+\\infty\\]<p>\\(x=1\\) es asíntota vertical.</p><p><b>Asíntotas horizontales.</b></p>\\[\\lim_{x\\to-\\infty}\\frac{e^x}{x-1}=\\frac{0}{-\\infty}=0\\qquad\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{e^x}{x-1}=\\left[\\frac\\infty\\infty\\right]\\overset{\\text{L'H}}=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}e^x=+\\infty\\]<p>\\(y=0\\) es asíntota horizontal en \\(-\\infty\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Regla de L'Hôpital: si el límite de \\(\\frac fg\\) da \\(\\frac00\\) o \\(\\frac\\infty\\infty\\), es igual al límite de \\(\\frac{f'}{g'}\\), si este existe.</i>. En \\(+\\infty\\) no hay horizontal; tampoco oblicua, porque \\(\\displaystyle m=\\lim_{x\\to+\\infty}\\frac{e^x}{x(x-1)}=+\\infty\\) (aplicando L'Hôpital dos veces).</p><div class='res'>Asíntota vertical \\(x=1\\); asíntota horizontal \\(y=0\\) en \\(-\\infty\\)</div></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>El dominio es \\(\\mathbb R\\setminus\\{1\\}\\): \\(x=1\\) es punto «problemático»<i class='n' data-t='why'>Los puntos «problemáticos» son los que no pertenecen al dominio (por ejemplo, los que anulan un denominador) y los puntos donde cambia la expresión de una función a trozos. Hay que marcarlos en la recta porque en ellos también puede cambiar el signo de la derivada.</i>. Estudiamos el signo de \\(f'\\)<i class='n' data-t='tp'>Dentro de cada intervalo la derivada no cambia de signo, así que basta sustituir un valor cualquiera del intervalo para conocer su signo.</i>.</p>\\[f'(x)=\\frac{e^x(x-1)-e^x}{(x-1)^2}=\\frac{e^x(x-2)}{(x-1)^2}=0\\iff\\boxed{x=2}\\]<div class='rs' style='overflow-x:auto;margin:.35rem 0'><svg viewBox='0 0 274 108' width='100%' style='max-width:329px;display:block;margin:auto' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='14.5' fill='currentColor'><path d='M14 52H260' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M96 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='96' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><circle cx='96' cy='52' r='4.5' fill='var(--card,#fff)' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><path d='M178 46V58' stroke='currentColor' stroke-width='1.6'/><text x='178' y='76' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><text x='29.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M43.0 10L79.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M70.0 39L79.0 40L77.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='55.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(0) &lt; 0</text><text x='111.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#e8487a'>−</text><path d='M125.0 10L161.0 40' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M152.0 39L161.0 40L159.0 31' stroke='#e8487a' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='137.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3/2) &lt; 0</text><text x='193.0' y='22' text-anchor='middle' font-size='22' font-weight='700' fill='#17a673'>+</text><path d='M207.0 40L243.0 10' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><path d='M234.0 11L243.0 10L241.0 19' stroke='#17a673' stroke-width='2' fill='none'/><text x='219.0' y='99' text-anchor='middle'><tspan font-style='italic' font-family='Georgia,serif'>f</tspan>′(3) &gt; 0</text></svg></div><p>Luego \\(f\\) decrece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\) y \\((1,2)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\lt0\\), y crece en \\((2,+\\infty)\\) debido a que \\(f'(x)\\gt0\\)<i class='n' data-t='th'>Si \\(f'\\gt0\\) en un intervalo, \\(f\\) crece en él; si \\(f'\\lt0\\), decrece.</i>. Tiene un mínimo relativo en \\(x=2\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Hay un mínimo donde \\(f\\) pasa de decrecer a crecer y un máximo donde pasa de crecer a decrecer.</i>, de valor \\(f(2)=e^2\\).</p><div style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 300 230' width='100%' style='max-width:380px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><polyline points='20.0,164.2 21.9,164.2 23.8,164.2 25.7,164.2 27.6,164.2 29.5,164.2 31.4,164.2 33.3,164.2 35.2,164.2 37.1,164.2 39.0,164.2 40.9,164.2 42.8,164.2 44.7,164.2 46.6,164.2 48.6,164.3 50.5,164.3 52.4,164.3 54.3,164.3 56.2,164.3 58.1,164.3 60.0,164.3 61.9,164.3 63.8,164.4 65.7,164.4 67.6,164.4 69.5,164.4 71.4,164.4 73.3,164.5 75.2,164.5 77.1,164.5 79.0,164.5 80.9,164.6 82.8,164.6 84.7,164.6 86.6,164.7 88.5,164.7 90.4,164.8 92.3,164.8 94.2,164.9 96.1,165.0 98.0,165.1 99.9,165.1 101.9,165.2 103.8,165.3 105.7,165.4 107.6,165.5 109.5,165.7 111.4,165.8 113.3,166.0 115.2,166.1 117.1,166.3 119.0,166.5 120.9,166.8 122.8,167.0 124.7,167.3 126.6,167.6 128.5,168.0 130.4,168.4 132.3,168.8 134.2,169.3 136.1,169.9 138.0,170.6 139.9,171.3 141.8,172.1 143.7,173.0 145.6,174.1 147.5,175.3 149.4,176.8 151.3,178.4 153.2,180.4 155.2,182.7 157.1,185.5 159.0,188.8 160.9,192.8 162.8,197.8 164.7,204.2 166.6,212.3 168.5,223.2 170.4,238.3 172.3,260.3' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><polyline points='188.7,-18.8 189.5,-5.5 190.4,5.3 191.2,14.2 192.0,21.7 192.8,28.0 193.7,33.5 194.5,38.1 195.3,42.2 196.2,45.7 197.0,48.8 197.8,51.5 198.7,53.8 199.5,55.9 200.3,57.7 201.2,59.3 202.0,60.7 202.8,62.0 203.7,63.0 204.5,63.9 205.3,64.7 206.2,65.4 207.0,65.9 207.8,66.4 208.7,66.7 209.5,67.0 210.3,67.2 211.2,67.3 212.0,67.3 212.8,67.3 213.6,67.2 214.5,67.0 215.3,66.8 216.1,66.5 217.0,66.1 217.8,65.7 218.6,65.3 219.5,64.8 220.3,64.2 221.1,63.6 222.0,63.0 222.8,62.3 223.6,61.6 224.5,60.8 225.3,60.0 226.1,59.1 227.0,58.2 227.8,57.2 228.6,56.3 229.5,55.2 230.3,54.1 231.1,53.0 231.9,51.8 232.8,50.6 233.6,49.4 234.4,48.1 235.3,46.8 236.1,45.4 236.9,44.0 237.8,42.5 238.6,41.0 239.4,39.4 240.3,37.8 241.1,36.2 241.9,34.5 242.8,32.7 243.6,31.0 244.4,29.1 245.3,27.2 246.1,25.3 246.9,23.3 247.8,21.3 248.6,19.2 249.4,17.1 250.2,14.9 251.1,12.6 251.9,10.3 252.7,8.0 253.6,5.6 254.4,3.1 255.2,0.5' fill='none' stroke='#2f6df0' stroke-width='2'/><line x1='181.0' y1='210.0' x2='181.0' y2='20.0' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='1.4' stroke-dasharray='5 4'/><circle cx='211.9' cy='67.3' r='3.5' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='217.9' y='71.3'>mín (2, e²)</text><g stroke='currentColor' fill='none' stroke-width='1.2'><path d='M12.0 164.1H294.0M150.0 224.0V8.0'/></g><line x1='26.2' y1='161.1' x2='26.2' y2='167.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='23.2' y='178.1' font-size='10'>-4</text><line x1='88.1' y1='161.1' x2='88.1' y2='167.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='85.1' y='178.1' font-size='10'>-2</text><line x1='181.0' y1='161.1' x2='181.0' y2='167.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='178.0' y='178.1' font-size='10'>1</text><line x1='211.9' y1='161.1' x2='211.9' y2='167.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='208.9' y='178.1' font-size='10'>2</text><line x1='242.9' y1='161.1' x2='242.9' y2='167.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='239.9' y='178.1' font-size='10'>3</text><line x1='273.8' y1='161.1' x2='273.8' y2='167.1' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='270.8' y='178.1' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='147.0' y1='111.7' x2='153.0' y2='111.7' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='115.7' font-size='10'>4</text><line x1='147.0' y1='59.3' x2='153.0' y2='59.3' stroke='currentColor'/><text x='134.0' y='63.3' font-size='10'>8</text></svg></div><div class='res'>Decrece en \\((-\\infty,1)\\cup(1,2)\\); crece en \\((2,+\\infty)\\). Mínimo relativo en \\((2,e^2)\\)</div></div>"
    }
   ],
