  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-2-4",
   "n": 4,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción A",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Halla unas ecuaciones paramétricas para la recta \\(r\\), que contiene al punto \\(P(3,-5,4)\\) y corta perpendicularmente a la recta \\(s\\equiv\\dfrac{x-4}5=\\dfrac{y-8}{-3}=\\dfrac z4\\).",
    "apartados": []
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Resolución",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(s\\) pasa por \\((4,8,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(5,-3,4)\\). La recta \\(r\\) pasa por \\(P\\) y por el pie \\(M\\) de la perpendicular de \\(P\\) a \\(s\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>Si \\(r\\) corta a \\(s\\) en \\(M\\) y es perpendicular a ella, \\(\\overrightarrow{PM}\\perp\\vec d\\): \\(M\\) es la proyección de \\(P\\) sobre \\(s\\).</i>.</p><p><b>Paso 1. Plano perpendicular a </b>\\(s\\)<b> por </b>\\(P\\)<b>:</b> \\(5x-3y+4z+D=0\\), con \\(P\\): \\(15+15+16+D=0\\iff D=-46\\).</p><p><b>Paso 2. Corte con </b>\\(s\\) \\((4+5t,\\,8-3t,\\,4t)\\):</p>\\[5(4+5t)-3(8-3t)+4\\cdot4t-46=0\\iff50t-50=0\\iff t=1\\Rightarrow M(9,5,4)\\]<p><b>Paso 3.</b> \\(r\\) pasa por \\(P\\) con director \\(\\overrightarrow{PM}=(6,10,0)\\parallel(3,5,0)\\).</p><div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":144,\"el\":52,\"p\":[[\"line\",[2.0,9.2,-1.6],[13.0,2.6,7.2],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[13.0,2.6,7.2],\"s\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"vec\",[4.0,8.0,0.0],[5.061,7.364,0.849],\"#16a34a\",\"d\",4,-4],[\"line\",[1.8,-7.0,4.0],[10.2,7.0,4.0],\"#c2410c\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[10.2,7.0,4.0],\"r\",\"#c2410c\",6,0],[\"line\",[8.537,4.228,4.0],[9.173,3.846,4.509],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[9.173,3.846,4.509],[9.636,4.618,4.509],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[3,-5,4],\"P\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[9,5,4],\"M\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 300' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m15r2a4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m15r2a4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m15r2a4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m15r2a4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='70.8' y1='246.0' x2='54.2' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='60.2' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>s</text><line x1='67.7' y1='204.5' x2='66.1' y2='182.6' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4' marker-end='url(#m15r2a4d)'/><text x='70.1' y='178.6' fill='#16a34a' font-weight='700'>d</text><line x1='265.4' y1='86.7' x2='26.0' y2='103.3' stroke='#c2410c' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='32.0' y='103.3' fill='#c2410c' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='73.4' y1='100.0' x2='72.4' y2='86.8' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><line x1='72.4' y1='86.8' x2='59.2' y2='87.7' stroke='#475569' stroke-width='1.3'/><circle cx='231.2' cy='89.0' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='238.2' y='83.0' font-weight='700'>P</text><circle cx='60.2' cy='100.9' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='67.2' y='94.9' font-weight='700'>M</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='14.6' y2='259.8' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='8.3' y='260.2' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>x</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='11.1' y2='277.4' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='3.5' y='284.0' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>y</text><line x1='24' y1='270' x2='24.0' y2='260.1' stroke='#64748b' stroke-width='1.2'/><text x='21.0' y='260.7' fill='#64748b' font-size='10'>z</text><g transform='translate(56.0,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>recta</text></g><g transform='translate(106.5,292)'><line x1='0' y1='-4' x2='14' y2='-4' stroke='#16a34a' stroke-width='2.4'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>vector director</text></g><g transform='translate(210.0,292)'><circle cx='6' cy='-4' r='3.8' fill='#e8487a'/><text x='18' y='0' font-size='10'>puntos</text></g></svg><p class='mut' style='font-size:.8rem;margin:.2rem 0;text-align:center'>Figura interactiva: arrástrala para girarla en 3D.</p></div><div class='res'>\\(r\\equiv\\begin{cases}x=3+3\\lambda\\\\y=-5+5\\lambda\\\\z=4\\end{cases}\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\((3,5,0)\\cdot(5,-3,4)=15-15+0=0\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    }
