  {
   "id": "matematicas-2015-reserva-2-8",
   "n": 8,
   "num": 4,
   "bloque": "Opción B",
   "puntos": "2,5",
   "enunciado": {
    "intro": "Sea \\(r\\) la recta de ecuación \\(\\dfrac{x+2}3=\\dfrac{y+1}4=z\\).",
    "apartados": [
     "(1,5 p.) Halla el punto de \\(r\\) que equidista del origen de coordenadas y del punto \\(P(4,-2,2)\\).",
     "(1 p.) Determina el punto de la recta \\(r\\) más próximo al origen de coordenadas."
    ]
   },
   "solucion": [
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado a",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>\\(r\\) pasa por \\((-2,-1,0)\\) con \\(\\vec d=(3,4,1)\\): \\(X(-2+3t,\\,-1+4t,\\,t)\\). Impongo \\(|\\overrightarrow{OX}|^2=|\\overrightarrow{PX}|^2\\):</p>\\[|\\overrightarrow{OX}|^2=(3t-2)^2+(4t-1)^2+t^2=26t^2-20t+5\\]\\[|\\overrightarrow{PX}|^2=(3t-6)^2+(4t+1)^2+(t-2)^2=26t^2-32t+41\\]\\[-20t+5=-32t+41\\iff12t=36\\iff t=3\\]<div class='res'>\\(X(7,11,3)\\)</div><i class='n' data-t='tp'>Comprobación: \\(|\\overrightarrow{OX}|^2=49+121+9=179\\) y \\(|\\overrightarrow{PX}|^2=9+169+1=179\\) ✓.</i></div>"
    },
    {
     "titulo": "Apartado b",
     "html": "<div class='ex'><p>Es la proyección \\(M\\) de \\(O\\) sobre \\(r\\)<i class='n' data-t='why'>El punto de la recta más cercano a \\(O\\) es el pie de la perpendicular trazada desde \\(O\\).</i>. El plano perpendicular a \\(r\\) por \\(O\\) es \\(3x+4y+z=0\\). Su corte con \\(r\\):</p>\\[3(-2+3t)+4(-1+4t)+t=0\\iff26t-10=0\\iff t=\\frac5{13}\\]\\[M\\left(-2+\\frac{15}{13},\\ -1+\\frac{20}{13},\\ \\frac5{13}\\right)=\\left(-\\frac{11}{13},\\ \\frac7{13},\\ \\frac5{13}\\right)\\]<div class='f3d' data-f='{\"az\":-51,\"el\":64,\"p\":[[\"line\",[-2.6,-1.8,-0.2],[1.0,3.0,1.0],\"#2563eb\",2.2,false],[\"txt\",[1.0,3.0,1.0],\"r\",\"#2563eb\",6,0],[\"line\",[0,0,0],[-0.846,0.538,0.385],\"#16a34a\",2.0,true],[\"line\",[-0.752,0.478,0.342],[-0.681,0.572,0.365],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"line\",[-0.681,0.572,0.365],[-0.776,0.633,0.408],\"#475569\",1.3,false],[\"pt\",[0,0,0],\"O\",7,-6],[\"pt\",[-0.846,0.538,0.385],\"M\",7,-6]],\"ley\":[\"recta\",\"vector director\",\"puntos\"]}' style='overflow-x:auto'><svg viewBox='0 0 340 169' width='100%' style='max-width:440px' font-family='system-ui,sans-serif' font-size='11' fill='currentColor'><defs><marker id='m15r2b4n' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#dc2626'/></marker><marker id='m15r2b4d' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#16a34a'/></marker><marker id='m15r2b4g' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#64748b'/></marker><marker id='m15r2b4r' viewBox='0 0 10 10' refX='9' refY='5' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' orient='auto'><path d='M0 0L10 5L0 10z' fill='#2563eb'/></marker></defs><line x1='26.0' y1='109.2' x2='314.0' y2='18.0' stroke='#2563eb' stroke-width='2.2'/><text x='320.0' y='18.0' fill='#2563eb' font-weight='700' font-style='italic'>r</text><line x1='182.1' y1='115.4' x2='16